{"lyrics":"[Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro]\n[00:08.40]Feel like I'm on top of the world (World)\n[Chorus]\n[00:32.44]Blood on the rose petals\n[00:35.18]Ever been killed in the meadow?\n[00:37.60]The nights get cold, ghetto\n[00:40.42]Doing anything to keep the heat on\n[00:42.92]They tell us that we ain't special\n[00:45.70]Chip on my shoulder for that one\n[00:48.02]Now a nigga ball hard like an AND1\n[00:50.68]No loss, I'm the boss, I'm the champion\n[Verse 1]\n[00:53.70]Big dog, it's about time to take the leash off\n[00:57.70]It's a damn shame I'm above y'all\n[00:59.96]Kill 'em all while goin' through withdrawals\n[01:03.70]Bankroll look too thick like Nicki\n[01:06.28]Car transform like my name Witwicky\n[01:08.82]Or was the name Taylor? Kill 'em off swiftly\n[01:11.60]Get rich or die trying, like 50\n[01:14.94]And I got a chopper with a fifty\n[01:17.26]Make it jump like a cricket, no Jiminy\n[01:19.84]Feel like Santa, I was jumpin' down they chimneys\n[01:22.20]Robbery, now I'm gettin' rich\n[01:23.88]I should go and buy a Mazdi\n[01:25.48]Gas cost a grip, nigga, highway robbery\n[01:28.04]Skate on a beat like my first name Rodney\n[01:30.78]Brother still shootin' up parties\n[01:32.94]I remember we were doin' that off the molly (Yeah)\n[Chorus]\n[01:36.12]Blood on the rose petals\n[01:38.80]Ever been killed in the meadow?\n[01:41.24]The nights get cold, ghetto\n[01:44.06]Doing anything to keep the heat on\n[01:46.30]They tell us that we ain't special\n[01:49.34]Chip on my shoulder for that one\n[01:51.66]Now a nigga ball hard like an AND1\n[01:54.32]No loss, I'm the boss, I'm the champion\n[01:57.30]Blood on the rose petals\n[02:00.02]Ever been killed in the meadow?\n[02:02.44]The nights get cold, ghetto\n[02:05.28]Doing anything to keep the heat on\n[02:07.76]They tell us that we ain't special\n[02:10.56]Chip on my shoulder for that one\n[02:12.86]Now a nigga ball hard like an AND1\n[02:14.80]No loss, I'm the boss, I'm the champion\n[02:16.48]No loss, I'm the boss, I'm the champion\n[02:17.80]No loss, I'm the boss, I'm the champion\n[02:21.78]No loss, I'm the boss, I'm the champion\n[Bridge]\n[02:24.46]Give me a minute to chill, yeah (Yeah)\n[02:33.06]Give me a minute to chill\n[02:35.12]Give me a minute to chill (Give me a minute to chill)\n[Verse 2]\n[02:40.26]Woke up hung over, I won't know sober\n[02:44.10]If it slapped me 'cross the face\n[02:45.72]I've been slapped for a couple of days\n[02:51.02]My cup runneth over, I'm looking for closure\n[02:56.34]What else can I say?\n[03:01.30]But the only thing I found was the bullshit\n[03:03.96]Preachin' like a pastor at a pulpit\n[03:06.60]But this not no church, it's Hell on Earth\n[03:09.46]It's Hell on Earth to the fullest\n[03:12.14]I've been preachin' like a pastor at a pulpit\n[03:17.20]But this ain't no church, it's Hell on Earth\n[03:20.08]It's Hell on Earth to the fullest (Hell on Earth to the fullest)\n[03:25.64]I smoke Backwoods filled with my demons\n[03:30.98]I pop my pills filled with my demons\n[03:36.06]Sorrow, depression, they use that against me as a weapon\n[03:40.10]I'm so hungry, I came back for seconds, yeah\n[Verse 3]\n[03:44.86]I need to chill\n[03:46.16]I fell in love with the drinks and the pills\n[03:48.84]I fell in love with the love and the thrills\n[03:51.42]I don't want to know what happens after that\n[03:55.36]Everything I say, girl, you can't battle that\n[03:58.04]Arguments, confrontations, we are far, far from perfect\n[04:03.28]But I know that you're worth it\n[04:05.92]Without you I'll be worthless, that's just facts\n[04:11.92]How come when I call, you the first one to call me back?\n[04:17.34]I ain't talkin' 'bout trains, baby girl, but I'm off track\n[04:21.50]Get me back on track\n[04:27.14]Feel like it's been forever since we fuckin', tryin' to get back on that\n[Bridge]\n[04:32.42]It was just earlier today, feels like forever ago\n[04:36.76]I don't wanna know about today\n[04:39.96]I done got the keys to my soul, shorty got the keys to my soul\n[04:45.74]I don't wanna be alone, I don't wanna be alone\n[04:50.98]Shorty got the key to my soul, shorty got the key to my soul\n[04:56.36]I don't wanna be alone, baby, I don't wanna be alone (Baby, I don't wanna be alone)\n[05:03.90]Same message, different bottle, one way or another\n[05:08.88]Flow so raw, mixtape probably gon' come with a rubber (Haha)\n[05:14.84]Flow so raw, mixtape come with a rubber\n[Verse 4]\n[05:18.86]Listening to Relapse\n[05:20.86]Wonderin' if I should have a relapse (Uh)\n[05:24.14]Should I say \"cold\", huh, so cold, brr, need to run that back\n[05:29.38]I had a plan all alone\n[05:32.26]Not a plan, not a man, no\n[05:34.76]Had a plan all along, I ain't want to be left alone\n[05:40.06]Had a plan all along, need your hand in mine, yeah I know\n[05:45.38]Had to plan along, whoof (Had to plan along)\n[05:53.40]I had to plan along, need you in my hands, I know\n[05:56.14]I knew all along, when we first met at the studio\n[Verse 5]\n[06:00.86]Instant, in an instant, chemistry\n[06:04.00]Instant, since an infant, symmetry\n[06:06.58]Different, I was different\n[06:08.68]I wasn't the same as niggas, I kept my distance (Uh)\n[06:11.86]Still in the streets, whoa (Uh, ayy)\n[06:13.84]Still had the street talk, still had the street swag (Uh, ayy)\n[06:17.18]Wasn't making beats, whoa (Uh, uh)\n[06:19.18]Wasn't making beats, nah, I was only killing 'em (Uh, ayy)\n[06:22.58]I feel like a beast, whoa (Uh, ayy)\n[06:24.54]I feel like a beast, whoa, unleash the beast mode (Uh)\n[06:27.52]Up, down, left, right, X, Y\n[06:30.20]I just entered in a cheat code, whoa (Just entered in a cheat code, whoa)\n[Verse 5]\n[06:36.36]Smoke my 'wood and chill in Hollywood\n[06:40.22]But I'm still from the Wish-A-Nigga-Would\n[06:43.04]Can't be touched, little too rough\n[06:45.70]Something like a virgin 'cause I can't be fucked over\n[06:49.00]Holy, never sober, what the fuck have I been doing?\n[06:53.78]I been on top, yeah, yeah, I been on\n[06:57.76]That bad bitch came from Babylon, yeah\n[07:00.58]Damn, I love Babylon, yeah, yeah\n[07:03.50]I know that she from Babylon (Haha)\n[07:06.44]Bad bitch from Babylon, yeah\n[07:08.52]I think I met my girl in Babylon, yeah\n[07:11.12]I think I fell in love in Babylon, yeah\n[Verse 6]\n[07:14.20]Hidden gardens, beg my pardon\n[07:16.86]Where do I park this Aston Martin?\n[07:19.50]Bentley truck, no keys to start it\n[07:22.28]I just push it, clip dumb like garbage\n[07:24.80]Never gave a fuck, no\n[07:26.14]Met her at the hidden gardens, gardens\n[07:28.78]We met up in Babylon, yeah\n[07:31.56]I took her to Babylon, yeah\n[07:34.08]Girl, let's go to Babylon, yeah\n[07:36.72]Let's go up to Babylon\n[07:37.98]Run the whole damn thing like a triathlon\n[07:40.66]Don't get involved\n[07:43.18]I know it's not the same as it used to be, but that's not my fault\n[07:48.24]I rip mine off my chest, I put it on the ground\n[07:50.68]Leave it on that sidewalk\n[07:53.68]Everywhere I walk, everything I say\n[Verse 7]\n[07:58.04]I feel like a god, god, but I know I'm far from it\n[08:03.24]Pull out the chopper, fuck nigga, start runnin'\n[08:08.66]I feel like I'm Birdman, damn, you know I'ma get to stuntin' (Yeah)\n[08:13.64]I'ma pull up in a Bentley, yeah, off-road like a hummer (Skrrt)\n[08:18.36]It's dark outside and it's cold\n[08:20.44]Kinda like the outside parts of my soul\n[08:23.10]Lone wolf, shorty, might howl at the moon\n[08:25.72]Trip off shrooms, I ain't coming back soon\n[08:28.38]Fuck this earth, nature's cool but I hate these folks\n[08:32.54]Hang myself with the songs I wrote\n[08:34.76]No need for a noose, untie this rope\n[08:39.04]Paint my nails, give me hell\n[08:41.50]For not being like you, bitch, oh well\n[08:44.18]You dress like him and you act like her\n[08:46.66]Bitch, I act like me, I dress so well\n[08:49.86]R-E-V-E-N-G-E on my body\n[08:52.66]Like OCD, I'm clean, yeah I got it like that\n[08:56.24]Shop 'til I drop, got time on my hands\n[08:58.94